{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sbhJ8qEqyQ1794719550.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>澳洲及菲律賓簽署國防協議，旨在加強情報共享。</p><p></p><p>在菲律賓出席東盟峰會的澳洲總理阿爾巴內塞，到訪停泊在馬尼拉的澳洲皇家海軍補給艦「堅毅號」，並見證澳菲簽署國防協議，澳洲廣播公司報道，協議包括擴大軍事准入、情報共享，並加強支援菲律賓海軍及海岸防衛隊。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.PHI.DEFENSE-1300-1_CLEAN_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VUDUjx3xhE1794719627.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>今次協議簽署正值澳洲加大對菲律賓海上防禦及安全的支持。自去年四月以來，已向菲律賓海岸警衛隊提供超過1,300萬澳元援助，主要涉及無人機及操作訓練，被指是應對中國在區內不斷擴大的影響力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:36:36.410381+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T04:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T02:24:10.995883+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:30:10.273001+00:00","content_hash":"b724f70fdf49083073a307b9750a590dfb01fa1b4924bb17f8996e703e034cd5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:36:36.410381+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}